# Firebase config. One project per BRAND (separate Google accounts), so the
# file lives in the flavour source set, never at app/ where it would apply to
# both. Carries an API key and a project id, which CLAUDE.md forbids putting
# in the repo — same rule POS follows. Download it from the Firebase console
# of that brand and drop it in app/src/<flavour>/.
google-services.json
